---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: Arial
    actorBkg: '#ffffff'
    actorBorder: '#475569'
    actorTextColor: '#172033'
    signalColor: '#64748b'
    signalTextColor: '#172033'
    noteBkgColor: '#fff6dd'
    noteTextColor: '#172033'
    noteBorderColor: '#475569'
  sequence:
    actorFontFamily: Arial
    messageFontFamily: Arial
    noteFontFamily: Arial
    mirrorActors: false
    useMaxWidth: false
---
sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(241,245,249) Game controller
    participant L as Lucas Chess
    end
    box rgb(219,232,251) UCI engine
    participant R as Remus7-Rust
    end
    L->>R: Start the executable (process launch)
    L->>R: uci
    R-->>L: id name Remus7-Rust
    R-->>L: option name Ponder type check default false
    R-->>L: option name Threads type spin default 4 min 1 max 64
    R-->>L: option name Hash type combo default 512 var 512 var 1024 var 2048
    Note over L,R: Other advertised options omitted here, the text transcript lists them.
    R-->>L: uciok
    L->>R: setoption name Ponder value true
    L->>R: setoption name Threads value 8
    Note over L,R: Hash stays at its 512 MiB default. Setoption has no individual acknowledgment.
    L->>R: isready
    R-->>L: readyok
    L->>R: ucinewgame
    L->>R: isready
    R-->>L: readyok
    Note over L,R: Ready for a position and go. No chess search starts during setup.
